    "de": [
      "Begleitung in den Bergen und damit verbundene Therapie (falls nötig) auf der Grundlage von Hypnose-, NLP- und Coaching-Techniken - in einer Praxis in Trévignin oder in den Bergen in den Bauges tätig."
    ],
    "en": [
      "Mountain coaching and associated therapy (if needed) based on the techniques of Hypnosis - NLP and coaching - practicing in a practice in Trevignin or in the mountains in the Bauges."
    ],
    "it": [
